#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.desktop.in:3
#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid "Owly Drop"
msgstr "Owly Drop"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.desktop.in:4
#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Send and receive files with iPhones over AirDrop"
msgstr "Échanger des fichiers avec un iPhone par AirDrop"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons. The list MUST also end with a semicolon.
#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.desktop.in:7
msgid "AirDrop;iPhone;iOS;Apple;share;transfer;"
msgstr "AirDrop;iPhone;iOS;Apple;partage;transfert;"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.gschema.xml:6
msgid "Name shown on iPhones"
msgstr "Nom affiché sur les iPhone"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.gschema.xml:7
msgid ""
"The name iPhones see in their AirDrop row. Empty means “Firstname's PC”."
msgstr ""
"Le nom que les iPhone voient dans leur liste AirDrop. Vide : « PC de "
"Prénom »."

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.gschema.xml:11
msgid "Download folder"
msgstr "Dossier de réception"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.gschema.xml:12
msgid "Where received files go. Empty means the Downloads folder."
msgstr "Où vont les fichiers reçus. Vide : le dossier Téléchargements."

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.gschema.xml:16
msgid "Accept automatically"
msgstr "Accepter automatiquement"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.gschema.xml:17
msgid "Accept every incoming file without asking."
msgstr "Accepter tous les fichiers reçus sans demander."

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Owly Drop makes AirDrop between iPhones and Linux a matter of flipping a "
"switch: become visible, accept what an iPhone sends, or drop files on the "
"window to send them back."
msgstr ""
"Owly Drop rend l'AirDrop entre iPhone et Linux aussi simple qu'un "
"interrupteur : devenez visible, acceptez ce qu'un iPhone envoie, ou glissez "
"des fichiers sur la fenêtre pour les lui envoyer."

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"It is a graphical front end for Owly, which runs Apple's AWDL Wi-Fi link and "
"the AirDrop protocol on ordinary Wi-Fi cards. Owly must be installed and "
"working with your Wi-Fi card."
msgstr ""
"C'est une interface graphique pour Owly, qui fait fonctionner le lien Wi-Fi "
"AWDL d'Apple et le protocole AirDrop sur des cartes Wi-Fi ordinaires. Owly "
"doit être installé et fonctionner avec votre carte Wi-Fi."

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "Accept or decline incoming files, or accept them automatically"
msgstr ""
"Accepter ou refuser les fichiers reçus, ou les accepter automatiquement"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Open received files or show them in their folder"
msgstr "Ouvrir les fichiers reçus ou les afficher dans leur dossier"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Send files to nearby iPhones, with a progress bar"
msgstr ""
"Envoyer des fichiers aux iPhone à proximité, avec une barre de progression"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "Choose the name iPhones see and the download folder"
msgstr "Choisir le nom que voient les iPhone et le dossier de réception"

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:39
msgid "Receiving from and sending to iPhones"
msgstr "Recevoir des fichiers d'un iPhone et lui en envoyer"

#: src/owly_drop/application.py:31
msgid "Show the version and quit"
msgstr "Afficher la version et quitter"

